      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TACTICAL ILLUSION (5) put some ordinary form behind her last start when she found the lead and did well to go on and score by 4 metres at Bathurst over 1730m. Meets a comparable field so she can keep the ball rolling. JACQUELYN JOY (2) saluted two starts ago at this track but didn't measure up at her latest appearance over 1720m at this track, beaten 17 metres into fourth after being close to the pace throughout. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a similar line up and she can figure in the finish. HESHARLEY (9) is close to a win after two successive seconds, the latest over 1720m at this track. Capable of taking this out. JILLIBY TOMCAT (1) has drawn to advantage and should give backers a great sight. Include in combinations.",
